{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhanggu-e-o122","title":"习凿齿论昭不臣","accounts":[{"id":"zhanggu-a-14c2b3838af7eb74738e","label":"裴注·习凿齿","text":"习凿齿论昭不臣","evidence":["zhanggu-q-9680d4016f3c0b32de1c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"gongsuntao-p0004","role":"评论张昭闭户拒命为不臣","evidence":["zhanggu-q-9680d4016f3c0b32de1c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-9680d4016f3c0b32de1c"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhanggu-q-9680d4016f3c0b32de1c","source_order":[52,88,0],"order":9267}],"persons":[{"id":"gongsuntao-p0004","name":"习凿齿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhanggu-q-9680d4016f3c0b32de1c","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-70b7a3fe08e8dc6b7073","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞习凿齿曰：“张昭于是乎不臣矣！夫臣人者，三谏不从，则奉身而退；身苟不绝，何忿怼之有？且秦穆违谏，卒霸西戎；晋文暂怒，终成大业。遗誓以悔过见录，狐偃无怨绝之辞；君臣道泰，上下俱荣。今权悔往之非而求昭，后益回虑降心；不远而复，是其善也。昭为人臣，不度权得道，匡其后失，夙夜匪懈，以延来誉；乃追忿不用，归罪于君，闭户拒命，坐待焚灭：岂不悖哉！”","attribution":"裴注·习凿齿","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-232cca93d73c0d3d09de","start":0,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
